#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-kernel-configuration.rst:5
#: fa5434910d9a4c80b4f8b258212e2dfc
msgid "Linux Kernel Configuration"
msgstr "Linux 内核配置"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-kernel-configuration.rst:8
#: 63de6a55a28046dcaf373272737aa96e
msgid "Real-Time Patches"
msgstr "实时补丁"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-kernel-configuration.rst:9
#: d5d8a736a8db4268a210833c498ff925
msgid ""
"For some builds, ArduPilot needs to run sensors, control loop, and output "
"interfaces at high rates, with bounded latency to maintain stable operation."
" For this reason, it is suggested to run a real-time kernel."
msgstr "对于某些构建，ArduPilot 需要以高频率运行传感器、控制循环和输出接口，并保持有界延迟以维持稳定运行。因此建议运行实时内核。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-kernel-configuration.rst:13
#: d2ec0efe2e1641dea44ca74f87b585a3
msgid "Builds like rover, sub, and tracker may be fine without it."
msgstr "Rover、Sub 和 Tracker 等构建可能无需实时内核。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-kernel-configuration.rst:16
#: 1446a54226044216b60dfbb99675f7b4
msgid "Userspace access to hardware peripherals on 64-bit boards"
msgstr "64 位飞控板上用户空间访问硬件外设"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-kernel-configuration.rst:17
#: 7972ba270dd74b74b331989c4f5f9067
msgid ""
"The default kernel configuration for many 64-bit boards blocks even the root"
" user from mmap()ing the peripheral device address space, allowing only the "
"kernel to access it."
msgstr "许多 64 位飞控板的默认内核配置甚至阻止 root 用户对外设地址空间执行 mmap()，仅允许内核访问。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-kernel-configuration.rst:21
#: 5d8ae7dfa5e14fac9f1e45ed9834b1df
msgid ""
"For many boards, ArduPilot will need such access, so CONFIG_STRICT_DEVMEM or"
" CONFIG_IO_STRICT_DEVMEM will need to be disabled."
msgstr ""
"对于许多飞控板，ArduPilot 需要此类访问权限，因此需要禁用 CONFIG_STRICT_DEVMEM 或 "
"CONFIG_IO_STRICT_DEVMEM。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-kernel-configuration.rst:24
#: 25340f920f0c483aa35d8df31e2de79e
msgid "32-bit kernels are unaffected."
msgstr "32 位内核不受影响。"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-kernel-configuration.rst:27
#: 59da14230f7f46afb6ef127c87dd23b1
msgid "Preventing CPU idle states"
msgstr "阻止 CPU 进入空闲状态"

#: ../../source/docs/ardupilot-on-linux-kernel-configuration.rst:28
#: 46b2ddc49b2641f7b6b091563f217593
msgid ""
"The kernel command line option ``cpuidle.off=1`` prevents CPU cores from "
"entering idle states. This can be useful on CPUs where exiting idle states "
"is slow."
msgstr "内核命令行选项 ``cpuidle.off=1`` 可阻止 CPU 核心进入空闲状态。这对于退出空闲状态较慢的 CPU 很有用。"
